{"thread":{"threadID":3006,"boardID":125,"topic":"Suche Mitspieler für DayZ Standalone!","time":1443422163,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","lastPostTime":1444565011,"lastPoster":"Baumi","replies":21,"views":2700,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[{"tagID":500,"name":"AMK"},{"tagID":498,"name":"DayZ"},{"tagID":497,"name":"DayZSA"},{"tagID":337,"name":"mitspieler"},{"tagID":499,"name":"Standalone"}],"posts":[{"postID":37971,"threadID":3006,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"Suche Mitspieler für DayZ Standalone!","time":1443422163,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Servus Leute :p</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hab seit Windows 10 Upgrade kein DayZ SA gezockt und naja...alleine is DayZ doof <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span> suche paar Mitspieler die ma ab und zu Lust hätten auf ne Runde. Mojo macht bestimmt auch mit <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Meinen Account findet ihr in meiner Signatur oder in der Beschreibung in meinem Channel auf TS</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Agz Craxto :p</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37988,"threadID":3006,"userID":1599,"username":"Abendstille","subject":"","time":1443439727,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bin gerne dabei !</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37990,"threadID":3006,"userID":null,"username":"Baumi","subject":"","time":1443439904,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bin auch dabei, konnte Sky auch schon dazu überreden. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37991,"threadID":3006,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1443440100,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1786,"username":"Syndicate","time":1443621701,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1443440594,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Holt euch die Mod, dann könnte man sich zu 7t oder so eine DREAM Base in Overpoch errichten.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Nochmal aus eigenem Interesse:<br>Was finden alle an der DayZ-SA? Ich mein, ich hab sie auch knappe 600hr gespielt, aber dann war es einfach nur noch Krampf. Geht es nur mir oder Ist die Mod einfach nur geiler als SA?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37995,"threadID":3006,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1443440608,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Geht nur dir so.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37996,"threadID":3006,"userID":null,"username":"Baumi","subject":"","time":1443440638,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Nein <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1758-vengeance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Vengeance</a> die Mod ist besser, aber es ist ein Krampf bis diese alle am laufen haben, da ich sehr oft einen Fehler habe der die Neuinstallation des spiel erfordert.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38001,"threadID":3006,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1443442523,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ja aber nur weil man Startprobleme hat muss man doch gleich die ganze Maschine wegschmeißen. 20 min und der Drops ist gelutscht. Wenn sich doch jemand entscheidet Mod mit zu spielen, ich helfe gerne bei Installationsfixes, sollten diese auftreten.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38003,"threadID":3006,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1443442914,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>als ich mir das letzte mal DayZ Mod geholt hatte, durfte ich mit 10 kb/s runterladen. permanent. Wieso auch immer.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38080,"threadID":3006,"userID":1933,"username":"Re(MiiX)","subject":"","time":1443546485,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich wäre auch auf jeden Fall dabei . Dann zocken wir auch mal wieder zusammen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span><br>Mit Dead Island hat das ja auch nicht so gut funktioniert. <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38084,"threadID":3006,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1443548102,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>okay <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38123,"threadID":3006,"userID":1786,"username":"Syndicate","subject":"","time":1443621766,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1443624133,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn man sich nicht vollends dumm anstellt, dann kriegt man die Mod in 1 Stunde zum laufen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>(Habe ich gestern gemacht).</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Außerdem kann man via Teamviewer, Skype etc. ebenfalls Hilfestellung leisten.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ez.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38512,"threadID":3006,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1444422555,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1860,"username":"MaikDieENTE","time":1444423077,"value":-1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1444425909,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>#Push <span class=\"missing-media\">[&